# DR. SHAMA ABIDI — AUTONOMOUS AI RESEARCH AGENT & INTERNATIONAL PHD CRM
# Environment Variables Template (.env.example)
# Copy this file to `.env` locally, or configure these keys in GitHub Actions
# Repository Secrets / Netlify Environment Variables for 24/7 Cloud Execution.
